== Walkthrough ==

There are two undead knights in the same room. Each knight accepts turn-ins for specific pieces of Darkforge Armor.

* Left undead knight: Bracer, Breastplate, Helm, Vambraces
* Right undead knight: Boots, Gauntlets, Greaves

