<br>

'''{{:Darkforge Helm}}'''

* [[Decayed Helm]]
* [[Decayed Visor]]
* [[Damaged Militia Helm]] x2 (dropped by militia guards in [[East Freeport]], [[West Freeport]], and the [[Northern Desert of Ro]])

<br>

'''{{:Darkforge Vambraces}}'''

* [[Decayed Left Vambrace]]
* [[Decayed Right Vambrace]]
* [[Qeynos Kite Shield]] ([[Northern Karana]] – [[Guard Shilster]] at 1380, -2764, in the northeastern corner of the zone)

:'''Note:''' Guard Shilster is the recommended source because he always drops the shield and has the smallest faction penalties of the listed guards. Killing him lowers Bloodsabers, Circle of Unseen Hands, Corrupt Qeynos Guards, and Kane Bayle by only 1 point each while raising Guards of Qeynos by 5.

